%% Fig. 2 — Account creation: success and the one failure mode, a duplicate account number.
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as Account API
    participant DB as accounts table

    C->>API: POST /accounts (accountNumber, ownerName, currency)
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO accounts
    alt account_number is unique
        DB-->>API: row created
        API-->>C: 201 Created
    else account_number already exists
        DB-->>API: unique violation
        API-->>C: 409 Conflict
    end
